{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cGodforsaken. No other word for it. A murder so brutal it made the whole town of Asbury Pines look itself in the mirror. We work, we raise kids, we do our best, we let time run its course, and then we\u2019re still left scratchin\u2019 our heads. Why did this evil have to happen?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                               <strong><i>                 - Rodney \u201cBuzz\u201d Snow, Sheriff of Asbury Pines</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asbury Pines is a first-of-its-kind story incremental/idler title. Combine and synthesize the work of Asbury Pines townfolk (the Pinies) to unveil a murder mystery across the small town\u2019s history \u2013 from the late stone age to the deep future. Immersive writing and image-rich worldbuilding pair with idle/incremental gameplay. As you unlock an array of characters, artifacts and places from one era to the next, combine them and their unique stats in different ways to build and link resource production economies\u2026 across centuries. What emerges is a sprawling factory of working lives that unveils a story embedded in the flow of time.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy gameplay that balances resource management, rich narrative development, automation/factory strategy, and idle progression, Asbury Pines was made for you!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/57ae1644cb7959c89c3852e2593ab100.avif?t=1766957452\" width=669 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Hrokk the caveman to Moharan the temporal physicist, strategize and connect the work of Pinies through the dozen eras of Asbury Pines history. As you create and modify your resource production engine, you unlock more people, places, and upgrades that combine to strengthen yields and unveil greater depths of a grand mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/ebcc949bfdbde6f99e0e62a5925b19cf.poster.avif?t=1766957452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/ebcc949bfdbde6f99e0e62a5925b19cf.webm?t=1766957452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The breadth and possibility of your plans grow alongside the story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/ffb04bb06517459a43c924fcac80a421.avif?t=1766957452\" width=669 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There ain\u2019t any angels among the Pinies, but a good many are hearty folk who aspire to make a proud home. How did this bizarre murder happen, and why? The narrative begins in the present day and spreads \u2013 past and future \u2013 across 12 eras from the late stone age to the deep hereafter. Each era brings more details, characters, intrigue, and answers to a mystery that spans the flow of time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/f9d6d85010f6aa80a55305ee04e93080.poster.avif?t=1766957452\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/f9d6d85010f6aa80a55305ee04e93080.webm?t=1766957452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore how individual insights, conversations, and documents \u2013 stories from wildlife, artifacts, inhabitants, heroes, and invaders \u2013 piece together and connect one era to the next, one answer to another. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/4356f69b227b00b10adc3178d34a70da.avif?t=1766957452\" width=669 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 people, plants, and animals with unique stats and backgrounds emerge across the history of Asbury Pines. They drive the mystery with their personal stories, age across timelines, and contribute to the resource growth needed to progress.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/85d5dce29454e8853bc2f0c6bf959dbc.avif?t=1766957452\" width=522 height=401 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive worldbuilding based on an image-rich narrative. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible and evolving progression systems that build on unlocked content, characters, and places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hours of balanced resource management, story development, and progression gameplay.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 characters with 350+ stories to discover and utilize.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline progression can be enabled/disabled and game speed increased for different play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions for consistent player experience.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Time Is of the Essence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2212790/42d04d253938519e93a1f16db1f33d59d780b9ff.jpg"},{"name":"Quiet Observers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2212790/9ea4e8af1dde26a567c1f6a87c31a4d2cfee5785.jpg"},{"name":"AI Armageddon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2212790/b690a54a43b241f824d437855a1e289e95cbbc90.jpg"},{"name":"The Wild Web ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2212790/602da40253f786a009180fbba1b94506cecb201e.jpg"},{"name":"Giant Leaps for Mankind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2212790/df30792ca8bf6f6b5f9aedadf5271b0831d9b879.jpg"},{"name":"The Great Flood 2.0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2212790/0bc093eac6d7f70b8f74f6ab8e066af4d6c4ada3.jpg"},{"name":"The Bee's Knees","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2212790/252d4973dafaa240e58f5e07f481a6abc82ad29f.jpg"},{"name":"Unbridled Industry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2212790/468bdb56b66764ecdb9e22948044bbced897dbcd.jpg"},{"name":"Sna-hail Massuma!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2212790/52f5c71912282ddd8ecee00dacfa3aaaf5f81309.jpg"},{"name":"A Town Is Born","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2212790/6e053ce68da9721109342fc2e6b293224d7b7317.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2212790?t=1766957452","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2212790?t=1766957452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766957452","capsule_imagev5":"