.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/57ae1644cb7959c89c3852e2593ab100.avif?t=1766957452\" width=669 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Hrokk the caveman to Moharan the temporal physicist, strategize and connect the work of Pinies through the dozen eras of Asbury Pines history. As you create and modify your resource production engine, you unlock more people, places, and upgrades that combine to strengthen yields and unveil greater depths of a grand mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/ebcc949bfdbde6f99e0e62a5925b19cf.poster.avif?t=1766957452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/ebcc949bfdbde6f99e0e62a5925b19cf.webm?t=1766957452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The breadth and possibility of your plans grow alongside the story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212790/extras/ffb04bb06517459a43c924fcac80a421.avif?t=1766957452\" width=669 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There ain\u2019t any angels among the Pinies, but a good many are hearty folk who aspire to make a proud home. How did this bizarre murder happen, and why? The narrative begins in the present day and spreads \u2013 past and future \u2013 across 12 eras from the late stone age to the deep hereafter. Each era brings more details, characters, intrigue, and answers to a mystery that spans the flow of time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=